== a05_textexactpush
  san:    exit 0 textexactpush List<String&>["text0-0", "text1-7"]|
  O3:     exit 0 textexactpush List<String&>["text0-0", "text1-7"]|
  interp: exit 0 textexactpush List<String&>["text0-0", "text1-7"]|
--- compile (-debug -sanitize)
built ./build/a05_textexactpush.debug.san
--- run san
textexactpush List<String&>["text0-0", "text1-7"]
--- run O3
textexactpush List<String&>["text0-0", "text1-7"]
--- interpret
textexactpush List<String&>["text0-0", "text1-7"]
